  entryLines:
  - text: Tak tohle bylo teprve o plnovous.
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Si cel\xE1 Branice?"
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: Jo, ale teda dal mi zabrat.
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Poj\u010F miz\xEDme, ne\u017E se tu objev\xED dal\u0161\xED."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
